71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i3LenUKxDoQQ7kNvwENdWPb&_nc_oc=AdrsDD9UIWcjxzBdMOtzpJm0SPxqVAtgO1WZ_dK95P3S7DrqEmVrvTWuZlZ6qk9qAAU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0VFm-n_1nmSI2TpT3QcEWLud4dd42WmvxvIMh08W9AQ&oe=6A806539"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zB7SV0l1Y2gQ7kNvwGERpjt&_nc_oc=Adod7Ads6IuYJPlRk7Y9NZKouHbp6O164GTPoJUnTniQacTS09NHOHgRrLD9KwZRw6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEAsrArBGNED5kY7am1TFHW6DNgkeAtuuS6MD3mTc0nZw&oe=6A803FD3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbpw9oHLNBUQ7kNvwHgem6w&_nc_oc=AdoTU-Fl-B7NQVc335UJYMh80E6J_7eJ1vve8ciXB2EPWJsxGF53SiAlKg9Esr8MTsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHSZlmFv-TASXQeksPh2XKstmEzOBxrTkTIxUriSx1UvA&oe=6A803E1A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: